<title>BERMUDA: RUGBY UNION-AUCKLAND LIFT RANFURLY SHIELD.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-AUCKLAND LIFT RANFURLY SHIELD.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, New Zealand 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auckland beat</p>
<p>Waikato 27-7 (halftime 7-7) to win the Ranfurly Shield rugby</p>
<p>union competition on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers -</p>
<p>Auckland -  Tries: Lee Stensness 2, Richard Fromont, Michael</p>
<p>Jones. Conversions: Adrian Cashmore (2). Penalty: Cashmore.</p>
<p>Waikato - Try: Simon Crabb. Conversion: Matthew Cooper.</p>
</text>
